  Traits:
  - Charismatic
  - Cunning
  - Ruthless
  - Diplomatic
  - Paranoid
  - Ambitious
  - Calculating
  - Loyal
  BackstoryTemplates:
  - '{name}, a veteran {role}, has served three administrations and trusts nobody.'
  - After the {location} scandal, {name} was moved here to keep {item} under wraps.
  - '{name} has been a {role} since the {enemy} incident and has never been the same.'
  - Once a powerful {role}, {name} now hides in the {location} pulling strings.
  EnemyNames:
  - Rogue Agent
  - Double Agent
  - Whistleblower
  - Opposition Leader
  - Mole
  ItemNames:
  - Classified Document
  - USB Drive
  - Sealed Envelope
  - Briefcase
  - Security Badge
  LocationNames:
  - Oval Office
  - War Room
  - Senate Floor
  - Archives
  - Situation Room
  - Press Room
  QuestNameTemplates:
  - Operation {location}
  - The {item} Affair
  - Deep State {enemy}
  - 'Executive Order: {location}'
  - The {location} Scandal
  TalkAndKillStep1:
  - Meet with {npc} in the {location} for a classified briefing.
  - Speak with {npc} about the {enemy} operating in the {location}.
  TalkAndKillStep2:
  - Eliminate the {enemy} before they leak from the {location}.
  - Take out the {enemy} hiding in the {location}.
  FetchAndDeliverStep1:
  - Retrieve the {item} from the {location} before it is destroyed.
  - Secure the {item} left in the {location}.
  FetchAndDeliverStep2:
  - Deliver the {item} to {npc} in the {location}.
  - Hand the {item} to {npc} personally. Trust no one else.
  ExploreAndReportStep1:
  - Sweep the {location} for surveillance devices.
  - Investigate the {location} for evidence of the {enemy}.
  ExploreAndReportStep2:
  - Report intel to {npc} in the {location}.
  - Debrief {npc} on what you found in the {location}.
  EnvironmentalNoteTemplates:
  - 'A memo stamped CLASSIFIED: The {item} must not leave the {location}.'
  - 'Post-it note: Trust no one in the {location}. The {enemy} has infiltrated.'
  - 'Shredded document fragment: ...{enemy} compromised... {item} missing from {location}...'
  - 'A redacted report: [REDACTED] confirms {enemy} has access to the {location}.'
  - 'Handwritten note: If I go missing, the {item} is hidden in the {location}.'
